[00:20.24]1. When a man becomes a father
[00:25.20]And a woman has a child of her own,
[00:29.78]They share a trust, they must remember,
[00:34.48]That is not theirs, not theirs alone.
[00:39.70]The gift they share is from Jehovah;
[00:44.22]Of life and love he is the one true Source.
[00:49.16]To parents he gives sure direction
[00:54.08]That they may follow the wisest course.
[00:59.16](Chorus)
[00:59.18]A sacred trust you have been given;
[01:04.06]A precious life is in your hands.
[01:08.92]You can bestow the greatest favor;
[01:14.04]Instruct your child in God’s commands.
[01:27.28]2. All the words God has commanded—
[01:32.02]They must always prove to be on your heart.
[01:36.66]These words you’ll speak to sons and daughters;
[01:41.24]This is your trust, this is your part.
[01:46.20]To them you’ll speak along your roadway,
[01:51.12]When you rise up and when you are at rest.
[01:56.48]In years to come, may they remember,
[02:01.40]May they be faithful, may they be blessed.
[02:06.00](Chorus)
[02:06.00]A sacred trust you have been given;
[02:10.96]A precious life is in your hands.
[02:15.80]You can bestow the greatest favor;
[02:20.90]Instruct your child in God’s commands.
